    <string name="audio_output_footer">Details follow the default media output; apps may route audio elsewhere. Supported formats and USB mixer modes are capabilities, not proof of the current playback format or bit-perfect audio.</string>
    <string name="audio_output_report_notes">This page follows the default media route. Apps using casting or their own routing may play elsewhere.\n\nBluetooth format describes the connection, not the original song or the transmission bitrate. Output profiles are formats Android reports as supported. USB mixer modes describe options available to compatible apps; they do not prove the current playback format or bit-perfect output. Analog profiles describe the phone or adapter, not the attached earphones. Higher numbers alone do not guarantee better sound.</string>
